","author":"孙应时","text":"渭上耕屯望一秋，鼓行那复更迟留。\n落星误尽痴儿辈，长说宣王抗武侯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":37341,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阅书库","author":"孙应时","text":"寒儒事业趁三馀，细字篝灯手自书。\n眼底牙签富连屋，妙年公子意何如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":37342,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄岩溪 其二","author":"孙应时","text":"苍山万叠锁荒烟，百道清溪思悄然。\n只有东风偏识路，马蹄花发自年年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":37343,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄岩溪 其一","author":"孙应时","text":"杜鹃声里谷幽幽，绿水平溪日夜流。\n花落空山人不到，一川烟雨起春愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":37344,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题寒草岩","author":"孙应时","text":"寒草岩前春鸟啼，桃花无数点清溪。\n我行已到神仙窟，不比渔郎此路迷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":37345,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠闾丘道人","author":"孙应时","text":"天下几人能具眼，世间万事可忘言。\n犹将笔墨澜翻说，多笑先生不惮烦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":37346,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丁未仲夏海陵官舍家大人赏月作诗恭和元韵","author":"孙应时","text":"官署成乡社，人圆月正圆。\n清欢閒里共，真乐酒中全。\n兴到因怀旧，诗成